   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  ４つ・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:22"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:59",
   "ptr": "0x59",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "　谷間の遺跡。\\n",
   "en": "The Valley Ruins. The Maccaloc Ruins. The Lake Ruins. The Black Dragon Cave Ruins.",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:6c",
   "ptr": "0x6c",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  マッカロックの遺跡。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　谷間の遺跡。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:59"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:87",
   "ptr": "0x87",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  湖の遺跡。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  マッカロックの遺跡。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:59"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:98",
   "ptr": "0x98",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  黒竜洞の遺跡です。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  湖の遺跡。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:59"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:b2",
   "ptr": "0xb2",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　谷間の遺跡はオールバインの町の北\\n",
   "en": "The Valley Ruins lie north of the town of Allvaine... past the Marshland, hidden quietly among the hills.",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:d9",
   "ptr": "0xd9",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ・・・湿原を越えた先に、山に囲まれ\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:b2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:102",
   "ptr": "0x102",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  て、ひっそりとたたずんでいます。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:b2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:12a",
   "ptr": "0x12a",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  私たちの仲間が、今、調査に向かって\\n",
   "en": "Some of our colleagues are on their way to survey it now.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:153",
   "ptr": "0x153",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  るところです。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:12a"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:169",
   "ptr": "0x169",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　他の遺跡のことは、その辺の本を読ん\\n",
   "en": "For the other ruins, please read the books around here.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:192",
   "ptr": "0x192",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  でください」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:169"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:1a8",
   "ptr": "0x1a8",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「封印してない本なら、自由に読んでか\\n",
   "en": "\"You're free to read any books that aren't sealed.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:1d1",
   "ptr": "0x1d1",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "  まいません」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:1a8"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:1f2",
   "ptr": "0x1f2",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「《古い本》を持ってきた？\\n",
   "en": "\"You brought an Old Book? Let's see......",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:211",
   "ptr": "0x211",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  どれどれ・・・・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:1f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:22d",
   "ptr": "0x22d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　うーん、これは、我々の探してる物に\\n",
   "en": "Hmm, this has nothing to do with what we're looking for. Sorry, but we can't buy it.",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:256",
   "ptr": "0x256",
   "len": 18,
   "jp": "  は関係無いな。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 18,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:22d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:26b",
   "ptr": "0x26b",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  悪いけど、買い取れないね。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  は関係無いな。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:22d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:28d",
   "ptr": "0x28d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ただ、古い魔導書みたいだから、売れ\\n",
   "en": "Still, it looks like an old grimoire, so it could fetch a good price. If you can find a buyer, that is...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:2b6",
   "ptr": "0x2b6",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  ばいい金額になると思うよ。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:28d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:2d7",
   "ptr": "0x2d7",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  ただし、買い手がいるかどうか・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:28d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:301",
   "ptr": "0x301",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "　・・・？\\n",
   "en": "...? Something else?",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:310",
   "ptr": "0x310",
   "len": 14,
   "jp": "  まだ何か？\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 14,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　・・・？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:301"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:322",
   "ptr": "0x322",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　責任者に会わせろ？\\n",
   "en": "You want to see whoever's in charge? ...Well, why not. She's in the back room.\"",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:33b",
   "ptr": "0x33b",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  ・・・ま、いいか。\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　責任者に会わせろ？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:322"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:354",
   "ptr": "0x354",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  奥の部屋にいるよ」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "  ・・・ま、いいか。\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:322"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:370",
   "ptr": "0x370",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「せっかく来たんだから、ここの蔵書も\\n",
   "en": "\"Since you came all this way, you should read some of our collection.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:399",
   "ptr": "0x399",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "  読んで行くといい」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:370"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:3cf",
   "ptr": "0x3cf",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "リール\\n",
   "en": "Riel",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:3da",
   "ptr": "0x3da",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「リール・レッドエリンと言います。\\n",
   "en": "\"My name is Riel Redellin. I've been made Chief of the survey team.\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "リール\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:401",
   "ptr": "0x401",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "　調査チームの主任を任されてます」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:3da"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:435",
   "ptr": "0x435",
   "len": 8,
   "jp": "「え？\\n",
   "en": "\"Huh? You're a scholar too? And the Chief, no less?!\"",
   "max": 8,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:440",
   "ptr": "0x440",
   "len": 22,
   "jp": "　あなたも学者なの？\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 22,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:435"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:459",
   "ptr": "0x459",
   "len": 20,
   "jp": "　しかも主任！？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 20,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "　あなたも学者なの？\\n",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:435"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:47d",
   "ptr": "0x47d",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「すみません、若くて・・・」\\f",
   "en": "\"Sorry... I know I'm young...\"",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:4ab",
   "ptr": "0x4ab",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "「あ、気にしないでね、ちょっと意外だっ\\n",
   "en": "\"Oh, don't mind me. I just didn't expect it, that's all.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:4d6",
   "ptr": "0x4d6",
   "len": 12,
   "jp": "  たから」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 12,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:4ab"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:4f2",
   "ptr": "0x4f2",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "「・・・あの、あなたは？\\n",
   "en": "\"...Um, and you are? That hair... Are you from abroad?\"",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:50f",
   "ptr": "0x50f",
   "len": 34,
   "jp": "　その髪・・・異国の方ですか？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 34,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:4f2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:541",
   "ptr": "0x541",
   "len": 28,
   "jp": "「わたしはシノブ・リュード\\n",
   "en": "\"I'm Shinobu Ryudo. ...If you're the Chief here, that's perfect. I have something to ask you.\"",
   "max": 28,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:560",
   "ptr": "0x560",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　・・・あなたがここの主任ならちょう\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:541"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:589",
   "ptr": "0x589",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "  どいいわ、聞きたいことがあるの」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:541"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:5bd",
   "ptr": "0x5bd",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「は、はい？」\\f",
   "en": "\"Y-yes?\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:5dd",
   "ptr": "0x5dd",
   "len": 36,
   "jp": "「遺跡を調査して、どうするつもり？\\n",
   "en": "\"What do you plan to do by surveying the ruins? And who ordered it?\"",
   "max": 36,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:604",
   "ptr": "0x604",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "　それを命じたのは誰？」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:5dd"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:62e",
   "ptr": "0x62e",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "「古代の人々の叡智（えいち）を手に入\\n",
   "en": "\"We hope that by gaining the wisdom of the ancients, the people of this country can live richer lives...",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:657",
   "ptr": "0x657",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  れることで、この国の民がより豊かに\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:62e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:680",
   "ptr": "0x680",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "  なることができればと・・・\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:62e"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:6a2",
   "ptr": "0x6a2",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "　領主ユーバウム公爵様のご意思のもと、\\n",
   "en": "We were gathered from all over by the will of the lord, Duke Yubaum-sama.\"",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:6cd",
   "ptr": "0x6cd",
   "len": 40,
   "jp": "  わたしたちは各地より集められました」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 40,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:6a2"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:705",
   "ptr": "0x705",
   "len": 30,
   "jp": "「そう・・・あなたたち・・・\\n",
   "en": "\"I see... You... no, all the people of this country have forgotten everything, haven't they?",
   "max": 30,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:726",
   "ptr": "0x726",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　いえ、この国の人々はみんな、すべて\\n",
   "en": "",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:705"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:74f",
   "ptr": "0x74f",
   "len": 26,
   "jp": "  を忘れてしまったのね。\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 26,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:705"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:76d",
   "ptr": "0x76d",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "  神殿が遺跡と呼ばれるようになるほど\\n",
   "en": "Over years so long that temples have come to be called ruins.\"",
   "max": 38,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:796",
   "ptr": "0x796",
   "len": 24,
   "jp": "  の、長い年月の間に」\\f",
   "en": "",
   "max": 24,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:76d"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:7be",
   "ptr": "0x7be",
   "len": 16,
   "jp": "「は・・・？」\\f",
   "en": "\"Pardon...?\"",
   "max": 16,
   "lines": 1,
   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "tl",
   "notes": ""
  },
  {
