   "speaker": "",
   "kind": "scn",
   "status": "box",
   "notes": "box: English in 06BLK01C:1330"
  },
  {
   "id": "06BLK01C:13bd",
   "ptr": "0x13bd",
   "len": 38,
   "jp": "　彼女は、幼い頃からその抜群の知能を\\n",
